{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Issue 463: Swift Etching hastes melee attacks and raises critical strike chance after Hurricane",
  "contract": [
    "Swift Etching 705600 (Riftblade passive, two dummy auras) reads 'After Hurricane ends, your melee attack speed",
    "is increased by $500506s1% and critical strike chance by $500506s2% for $500506d.' Its buff 500506 is aura 138",
    "SPELL_AURA_MOD_MELEE_HASTE BasePoints 14 (15%) and aura 290 SPELL_AURA_MOD_CRIT_PCT BasePoints 9 (10%), duration",
    "index 1 (10 s). Nothing cast 500506 on main: the Hurricane aura's removal handler only served Waveforged.",
    "Hurricane 645435 lasts 2 s. Expected: no buff without the talent or while Hurricane still strikes; with the",
    "talent the buff appears when Hurricane ends, shortens the 3.8 s Arcanite Reaper swing to 3.8/1.15 s, adds 10",
    "melee critical strike points and wears off after 10 s."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
